cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Si usas esta herramienta o sus ideas, cítala así. / If you use this tool or its ideas, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Metacognition: Poliedro de observación / Observation polyhedron"
abstract: >-
  Interactive tool for looking at an object of study from several frames of
  observation placed on the vertices of a regular polyhedron. Each frame sees
  a cap of the object and misses the rest; the tool shows what each frame
  sees, the dialogue zones where frames overlap, and the collective blind
  spot that no frame reaches.
